<title>USA: Key Clinton aide resigns, NBC says.</title>
<headline>Key Clinton aide resigns, NBC says.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dick Morris, the Republican political consultant who reshaped U.S. President Bill Clinton's reelection campaign, has resigned, MS-NBC News reported Thursday.</p>
<p>Morris drew the ire of liberal Clinton aides for repositioning the president in the political centre. There was no immediate comment on the report from the White House.</p>
